<h1 style="margin:0 0 20px;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:22px;line-height:30px;font-weight:600;color:#18181b">Rechnung 2026-042</h1>
